# Marketing Park (`marketing_park` / `kit_content`)

- Product package: **`marketing_park`**. Platform module: **`kit_content`**. Org/tenant: **`KIT_MKT`**.
- Independent park. Do **not** add Content migrations to `deploy/ubuntu/migration-files.prod.txt` (Pharmacy) or `migration-files.family-os.txt`.
- Apply via `deploy/ubuntu/migration-files.content.txt` only (281+ including `286_pack_content_marketing_park_tenant.sql`). Runner: `deploy/ubuntu/run-kit-migrations-content.sh` / `apply-kit-migrations-content.sh` — never `migration-files.prod.txt`.
- Do not couple Content services to Pharmacy sales/inventory tables or Family OS workers.
- Do not show Marketing nav on Novixa/Famixa tenants — gate with `platformModule: kit_content` + vertical `marketing`.
- Prefer **dynamic JSON catalogs** (connector types, channel types, variant kinds, image rates) over new ALTER TABLE for each brand/site/page.
- Budget ceilings are first-class settings; do not hardcode USD rates in C# beyond seeds.
- Expanding web/page = new `site_target` / `channel_target` rows, not a platform upgrade.
- Brands (KIT, Novixa, Famixa, Vân Đỉnh Trà) are **content brands inside KIT_MKT**, not product packages.
- Content Package (`pack_content.content_package`) = Core Idea (or a brand adaptation via `source_package_id`). Idea Pool: batch Brand Fit, operator confirms cells, then create adaptations. Tab «Gợi ý tiếp» đề xuất ý gốc mới từ catalog đã có — operator tick rồi thêm vào pool. Do not auto-fanout to all brands. Do not add a `ContentIdea` table.
- Video Factory (`pack_content.video_*`): từ Package kéo `tiktok_script` → storyboard local; Creatomate optional (`Content:CreatomateApiKey`). Không auto-post TikTok.
- Famixa **bản dựng** (`pack_content.series_build`, mig 315): mỗi hàng = một lần dựng (graph Voice/KF/take URL). Không giới hạn tập. Tệp KF/TTS/take ở máy (IndexedDB / path), **không** dataUrl lên server. Ô dán `packDraft` chỉ local — PUT server không gửi nguyên văn kịch bản. Chọn hàng → mở đúng dây chuyền bản đó. Nhận pack ghi đè bản đang mở. Xóa hẳn = user bấm Xóa. `series_pilot` vẫn là graph đang mở + `active_build_id`. `/content/videos` không preload Series trên mọi trang Content.
- KIT Video Engine V1 Phase 01 (`pack_content.video_project` / `video_universe` / `video_production` / `video_shot_state` mig 333 + `video_generation_job` / `video_generation_attempt` / `video_provider_task` mig 334): Engine ≠ Project. Famixa is a consumer (`kit-video-famixa-adapter.ts`) — no `FamixaVideoEngine` / `FamixaRunwayService`. Creative `state` stays CP1; `run_status` is READY/RUNNING/SUCCEEDED/FAILED/BLOCKED/CANCELLED/PARTIALLY_COMPLETE. One FAILED shot → PARTIALLY_COMPLETE, never episode FAILED. HOLD (no Action) cannot create a GenerationJob or call a provider. Credit gate: PRECHECK → READY → USER CONFIRM → SUBMIT. IdempotencyKey: double Confirm = one paid job. HTTP 200 ≠ SUCCESS — only Provider SUCCEEDED + URL + downloaded + IMediaValidator. Famixa turbo path still exists; Phase 01 job API is the gated ledger.
- KIT Video Engine Phase 02 (`video_asset` / version / reference / usage / scene_master / shot_package / keyframe_snapshot, mig 335): generic Asset kinds Character/Location/Product/Prop/Vehicle/Animal/Other/Wardrobe. Canon = structured JSONB, not a prompt blob. Only APPROVED|LOCKED enter production. LOCKED version is immutable — new look = V2. Character Identity + Era (Minh ERA-01/11, ERA-02/16, ERA-03/23 = one CHAR-001). IAssetResolver builds Shot Asset Package; missing required asset = BLOCKED / CREATION REQUIRED — never invent CHAR-005+ or Ông/Bà. IImagePromptCompiler only — UI must not string-concat prompts; no dialogue in image prompt; I2V source = APPROVED KEYFRAME never character crop. Preflight + keyframe QA (extra/missing people, missing prop, action visibility) FAIL blocks I2V. Approved keyframe snapshot is immutable (regen SH03 does not rewrite SH01/02). `famixa_character` stays Famixa registry; engine assets link via extra_json source. Phase 02 Keyframe QA is declared (not pixel vision) — correct until Phase 04.
- KIT Video Engine Phase 03 (`video_story_graph` / `video_continuity_override`, mig 336): SCRIPT is SoT. Derive SCENE → BEAT → SHOT → ACTION → STATE → CONTINUITY. Do not invent characters / actions / dialogue / props / lessons. No Action → HOLD (no KF/I2V/LipSync/Final). Action must be observable. DialogueSegmentId mapped or UNASSIGNED — never dump onto last shot. Duration is estimated, not forced 5/10. ContinuitySnapshot immutable; inherit wardrobe/location/props/identity/time unless Script changes. No teleport. IContinuityValidator → PASS/WARNING/FAIL; FAIL blocks KF. Human override of WARNING only (Reason + ApprovedBy + Timestamp). Regen SH01-03 = Attempt 02 only. Insert renumbers display_code, keeps UUID. Script change = impact analysis, not silent full rebuild. Production queue takes READY+; keep HOLD/FAILED in graph.
- KIT Video Engine Phase 04 (`video_visual_contract` / `video_keyframe_attempt`, mig 337): APPROVED SHOT → VisualContract → Prompt Compiler → IImageGenerator → Vision QA → Director APPROVED → Immutable KF. Beautiful ≠ correct. P0 FAIL (character / count / action / required prop+state / location / identity) beats high scores. Contract ≠ prompt — UI must not string-concat. Prompt sections SUBJECT/ACTION/ENVIRONMENT/COMPOSITION/CAMERA/LIGHTING/STYLE/CONTINUITY/NEGATIVE — no dialogue, no JSON dump, no TTS/Runway/LipSync. Character from Canon+Version+Era+Reference, not free prompt. I2V source = APPROVED_KEYFRAME never character crop. Attempts are immutable; same fingerprint after FAIL = DO_NOT_BLIND_RETRY. Diagnose then change strategy. FAIL candidate cannot be reference. Director APPROVE only after QA PASS. I2V_READY_PACKAGE is prepared here — Phase 04 QA may be declared/structured. Gemini is one IImageGenerator, not the engine.
- KIT Video Engine Phase 05 (`video_keyframe_attempt` pixel columns, mig 338): real `GeminiImageGenerator` + durable JPEG artifact (1280×720) + real `IImageVisionAnalyzer` pixel QA. HTTP 200 ≠ IMAGE_READY. Config via server/env (`KIT_VIDEO_IMAGE_PROVIDER` / `KIT_VIDEO_GEMINI_MODEL`) — no key in browser. Same fingerprint = DO_NOT_BLIND_RETRY. MAX_AUTO_ATTEMPTS=3. P0 UNCERTAIN → REVIEW_REQUIRED. I2V_READY only after VISION PASS + Director APPROVE. **Do not call Runway / LipSync / Final.** Do not start Phase 06. Do not auto-LOCK Canon or rewrite Scene Master.
